page('Practical supplement: sources','REFERENCE',[
 'Edition 0.2 adds formula practice, static rigging calculations, model-specific torch references and original paper-template instructions. Independently computed examples and diagrams are training material, not job approvals.',
 'Saddle ordinates are derived here from the intersection of two perpendicular circular cylinders. Validate a paper trial on the actual diameters before fabrication. No commercial manual text or saddle table was copied.',
 'A qualified rigging reviewer and oxy-fuel instructor must review these chapters before commercial release. Manufacturer values are selected factual data with attribution, not a licensed reproduction of a complete chart.'],source='\n'.join(f'[{n}] {name}\n{url}' for n,name,url in EXTRA_SOURCES[:3]))
page('Torch and marking references','REFERENCE',[
 'Read the complete current equipment instructions. The retrieved Smith manual URL retains an older filename but serves revision H. Recheck the actual revision and chart before operation.',
 'Settings on page 41 apply only to the named SC12 equipment family. To prepare another table, record the torch and attachment models, tip series, gas, thickness, hose arrangement and manufacturer source.'],source='\n'.join(f'[{n}] {name}\n{url}' for n,name,url in EXTRA_SOURCES[3:]))
